# How accepted NeurIPS papers in this audience are written

Measured from 14 NeurIPS main-track papers (2024: 6, 2025: 8; 15 chosen, one excluded for an anomalous PDF) on evaluation of language models and label-efficient / prediction-powered evaluation. Method, sample and limits: `profile/README.md`, `profile/sample.json`. These are **camera-ready** versions: 10 content pages, one more than the 9 of a submission (`venue.md`). Counts are measurements of that sample, a purposive one, not a rule of the venue.

